WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.584
You can't grow on Amazon without ads.

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:08.513
Honestly, that's not a bad thing.

00:00:08.513 --> 00:00:17.680
I am Pallavi Pande, owner and founder at Dtocs Tableware Brand from Portland, Oregon.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.450
I am an Amazon seller and I spend thousands of dollars on ads across U.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:22.768
S.

00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:23.404
and Canada.

00:00:23.404 --> 00:00:24.358
And guess what?

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:27.220
We have 10x return on our ad spend.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.767
Here's the biggest insight.

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:32.253
Ads are not just for running sales, they're your fastest way

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:33.520
to learn with data.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:39.737
Ads actually tell you what your customers are searching for, what keywords convert, what images

00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:42.860
get clicks on, and what actual pricing works.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.954
Organic growth has limits, but ads unlock the data.

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:48.360
Think of it as a simple funnel.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.795
First, awareness.

00:00:49.795 --> 00:00:53.260
Your product shows through discovery ads.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.380
Second, clicks your keyword plus targeting brings traffic.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.805
Third, conversion.

00:00:59.805 --> 00:01:00.871
Your listing

00:01:00.871 --> 00:01:04.600
plus A+ content close the sale.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.532
And fourth, retention.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.602
Your brand builds repeat

00:01:08.602 --> 00:01:09.120
customers.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:13.475
At every step, you're collecting insights that you can use to improve your

00:01:13.475 --> 00:01:14.120
entire business.

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.006
Here's what I wish I knew earlier.

00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:19.480
Don't underfund ads and expect results.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.854
A budget isn't just spend.

00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:22.635
It's data.

00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:24.980
And data leads to smart decisions.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.437
So yes, Amazon

00:01:26.437 --> 00:01:27.926
ads are not optional.

00:01:27.926 --> 00:01:30.160
And that's exactly why they're powerful.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.213
Because the faster you

00:01:32.213 --> 00:01:34.280
learn, the faster you grow.
